                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Griscom.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-12-11"><hi rendition="#italic">December 11,
                        1900</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that the <hi rendition="#italic">Kentucky</hi> has been ordered
                    by the Navy Department to remain.)</p>
